# Introduction
These are my documents and notes.

# Build
## Redhat / DNF
Install packages
```
dnf install python3-pip git httpd mod_ssl mod_security httpd-tools
mkdir /var/www/html/docs
cd /var/www/html/docs/
git clone git clone https://github.com/rezizter/docs.git
ln -sf docs/mkdocs.yml mkdocs.yml
cd docs
python -m venv ~/.cache/venv/python
source ~/.cache/venv/python/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
mkdir /opt/scripts
cp /var/www/html/docs/docs/scripts/* /opt/scripts/
chmod +x /opt/scripts/build_site.sh
```
Now build the site
```
/opt/scripts/build_site.sh
```


## Ubuntu
Install packages
```
apt install python3-pip git apache2 python3.11-venv
```



